arm64: dts: renesas: build the RZ/V2H Robot RDK dtb

Register r9a09g057h44-rzv2h-rdk.dtb in the renesas dts Makefile. The matching
r9a09g057h44-rzv2h-rdk.dts is dropped into the tree by the linux-renesas
bbappend (do_configure:prepend) rather than carried as a patch, to keep the
board dts readable and easy to diff against the vendor source.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Avocado board support]

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/Makefile
@@ -148,5 +148,6 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_R9A09G047) += r9a09g047e57-smarc.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_R9A09G047) += r9a09g047e57-smarc.dtb
 
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_R9A09G057) += r9a09g057h44-rzv2h-evk.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_R9A09G057) += r9a09g057h44-rzv2h-rdk.dtb
 
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_RCAR_GEN3) += draak-ebisu-panel-aa104xd12.dtbo
